# Mechanic: Choose an opponent-owned creature from their library and put it under your control.
# Forcing: Bribery is the only spell and Centaur Courser is the only eligible search result.
# AI behavior: No hand or battlefield cards interrupt resolution.
# Failure modes: Wrong search domain blocks selection; wrong transfer fails battlefield assertions.
# Card roles: Bribery transfers Courser; Islands pay its cost; Forest proves play continues.
# Protocol path: Opponent target, library search, zone transfer, then land play.
